WEBVTT

01:25.870 --> 01:31.580
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.210 --> 01:39.550
[Episode 35 Turn the Tide]

02:04.660 --> 02:06.110
Who am I?

02:07.160 --> 02:08.610
Master.

02:10.880 --> 02:14.980
Heart Devouring Powder is such a good thing.

02:21.150 --> 02:22.600
Sit.

02:47.660 --> 02:49.736
Now that I look at you closely,

02:49.760 --> 02:51.920
I have to say you're pretty.

02:52.980 --> 02:53.786
It's a pity

02:53.810 --> 02:56.730
that Yun Xiang got you before me.

03:10.390 --> 03:14.060
I can do whatever I want with you now.

03:14.090 --> 03:16.520
Although it's less fun,

03:16.800 --> 03:18.566
when I think of Yun Xiang's face

03:18.590 --> 03:19.870
when you meet him in disheveled clothes

03:19.870 --> 03:22.550
after I get everything I want,

03:23.750 --> 03:28.170
I'm filled with excitement.

04:17.860 --> 04:20.309
I've had many enemies in my life.

04:20.440 --> 04:22.700
None of them has ever underestimated me.

04:23.690 --> 04:27.196
Where do you get the nerve to assassinate me?

04:27.220 --> 04:28.796
No time for trash talk.

04:28.820 --> 04:30.270
Get her!

05:28.230 --> 05:29.586
Yuanjie.

05:29.610 --> 05:31.226
Mother, leave this to me.

05:31.250 --> 05:32.025
Keep yourself safe.

05:32.049 --> 05:32.986
Stay out of it!

05:33.010 --> 05:34.126
Even if it may cost me my life,

05:34.150 --> 05:36.040
I won't allow anyone to mess with the Lingyuan Sect!

05:49.299 --> 05:50.870
Yuanjie!

06:32.260 --> 06:34.076
You had lots of nerve

06:34.100 --> 06:36.010
to poison a poison master.

06:40.390 --> 06:41.726
This poison is called Hidden Cold Scale.

06:41.750 --> 06:43.196
Whether you eat it or inhale it,

06:43.220 --> 06:44.716
you'll stop breathing

06:44.740 --> 06:46.230
as if you're dead.

06:46.470 --> 06:48.436
Do you want to know

06:48.460 --> 06:50.260
where you'll wake up in three days?

06:54.670 --> 06:57.496
I'm itching to slice your throat now,

06:57.520 --> 07:00.240
but you're still of use to me.

07:03.670 --> 07:06.540
What you said just now disgusted me.

07:07.820 --> 07:10.600
How should I teach you a lesson?

07:13.570 --> 07:17.440
You're effeminate.

07:18.140 --> 07:19.590
How about

07:20.660 --> 07:23.190
I take something that you don't need?

07:44.780 --> 07:48.740
Kou Yuanjie gave you the Heart Devouring Powder, right?

08:18.810 --> 08:21.506
Mother, don't blame me.

08:21.530 --> 08:23.330
They gave me no choice.

08:34.980 --> 08:37.740
I wish I could gouge out my eyes.

08:45.860 --> 08:47.460
I wasted my whole life

08:48.390 --> 08:50.450
chasing fame

08:53.260 --> 08:56.510
and didn't raise you well.

08:56.730 --> 08:58.180
Mother.

08:59.090 --> 09:00.980
I did it for the Lingyuan Sect.

09:36.660 --> 09:38.110
Mother.

09:39.130 --> 09:40.580
Mother!

09:47.380 --> 09:48.830
Mother!

09:56.820 --> 09:58.470
If Kou Lianyi finds out,

09:58.530 --> 09:59.986
she won't let me get away with it.

10:00.010 --> 10:01.386
She won't let me get away with it.

10:01.410 --> 10:02.746
Master Kou, leave this place now.

10:02.770 --> 10:04.470
I'll take care of the rest.

10:36.500 --> 10:37.950
Mother.

10:40.350 --> 10:41.800
Mother!

10:42.940 --> 10:44.390
Mother.

10:52.990 --> 10:54.440
Mother.

10:54.880 --> 10:56.890
-Mother. -Both you and I are late.

10:58.650 --> 11:00.980
Do you recognize this knife, Lady Kou?

11:05.800 --> 11:07.730
Your brother has run away with the seal.

12:08.920 --> 12:11.706
You saw through my plan last time.

12:11.730 --> 12:13.530
I was so surprised.

12:14.640 --> 12:16.800
Why don't you take a guess again?

12:17.500 --> 12:19.910
What do you think I'll do next?

12:23.760 --> 12:26.716
You'll tell all the branches of the Lingyuan Sect

12:26.740 --> 12:28.190
to get prepared for wars

12:28.500 --> 12:31.500
so that you can rise up when it's time.

12:32.720 --> 12:33.636
Go on.

12:33.660 --> 12:35.220
To the north of Yangzhou is the Central Plain.

12:35.250 --> 12:36.676
Roads there lead everywhere.

12:36.700 --> 12:40.140
So when the war starts, it'll definitely come under siege.

12:40.730 --> 12:42.106
Nandu, on the contrary,

12:42.130 --> 12:43.816
has the river as a natural barrier

12:43.840 --> 12:45.360
and supplies are abundant.

12:45.930 --> 12:47.386
So next, you'll

12:47.410 --> 12:49.270
order the troops in Yangzhou

12:49.300 --> 12:51.616
to cross the river and guard Nandu.

12:51.640 --> 12:54.280
You'll be able to sustain a prolonged war and expand your reach.

12:55.070 --> 12:58.040
Then what?

12:58.400 --> 12:59.980
I don't know.

13:01.140 --> 13:02.590
You don't?

13:05.740 --> 13:07.190
No.

13:10.110 --> 13:11.750
You guessed right.

13:12.050 --> 13:15.050
I'll go to Yangzhou to deploy the troops soon.

13:15.080 --> 13:16.890
Come with me.

13:24.770 --> 13:26.220
Prince Fu.

13:26.350 --> 13:27.800
What's it?

13:28.810 --> 13:31.200
Something happened to Mr. Nangong.

13:46.150 --> 13:47.546
Where is Kou Yuanjie?

13:47.570 --> 13:48.616
I couldn't find him anywhere.

13:48.640 --> 13:49.996
I'm afraid he's run away.

13:50.020 --> 13:52.836
It's the Kou family's family business that he killed his mother.

13:52.860 --> 13:54.436
I won't interfere with it.

13:54.460 --> 13:55.910
But Kou Lianyi

13:57.240 --> 13:59.630
killed an important disciple of the Yuntai Sest.

13:59.780 --> 14:02.220
That can't go unanswered.

14:04.130 --> 14:08.600
Your disciple tried to poison me and assault me

14:08.910 --> 14:11.230
when I came to meet him.

14:11.750 --> 14:15.190
I don't think the Yuntai Sect needs a pest like him.

14:15.450 --> 14:16.536
Yun Xiang.

14:16.560 --> 14:19.040
Kou Lianyi killed your senior.

14:19.670 --> 14:21.440
What should we do about her?

14:21.780 --> 14:23.590
She should pay with her life.

14:29.680 --> 14:31.310
But if Kou Lianyi dies,

14:31.370 --> 14:32.930
Kou Yuanjie won't last long.

14:33.130 --> 14:33.666
In that case,

14:33.690 --> 14:36.480
the Lingyuan Sect will be left without a leader.

14:36.710 --> 14:38.160
I'm afraid that would be a problem.

14:39.460 --> 14:41.380
So you want me to let it slide?

14:41.520 --> 14:45.080
I just don't want you to be seen as uncaring and reckless.

14:47.960 --> 14:50.240
Kou Yuanjie is so ambitious.

14:50.340 --> 14:52.150
That's surprising.

14:52.780 --> 14:54.230
Forget it.

14:55.840 --> 14:57.550
Nangong Fang indulged in lust.

14:58.110 --> 14:59.796
He violated the sect rules.

14:59.820 --> 15:01.710
But given that he was a disciple of the Yuntai Sect,

15:02.150 --> 15:05.126
let him be buried in the back mountain

15:05.150 --> 15:06.980
with Mo Bufan and Kang Qiao.

15:07.020 --> 15:08.626
Kou Lianyi, you have to know

15:08.650 --> 15:11.980
that death is too severe a punishment for Nangong Fang.

15:18.030 --> 15:21.810
What's done is done. I won't punish you.

15:22.020 --> 15:23.706
If you see your brother after going back,

15:23.730 --> 15:25.220
have a nice talk with him.

15:25.470 --> 15:29.156
You have your ways of holding Madam Kou's funeral.

15:29.180 --> 15:32.246
Do it properly and don't let grief consume you.

15:32.270 --> 15:33.136
The Lingyuan Sect

15:33.160 --> 15:35.540
will depend on you in the future.

15:36.530 --> 15:37.980
Yun Xiang.

15:38.350 --> 15:39.800
Come with me.

15:52.550 --> 15:55.330
What do you think of what happened today?

15:57.110 --> 15:59.650
A candle is supposed to light the dark,

16:00.190 --> 16:01.776
but the darkest place

16:01.800 --> 16:03.730
is right under the candlestick.

16:03.780 --> 16:05.500
I'm relieved for you

16:05.540 --> 16:07.976
that Nangong Fang died.

16:08.000 --> 16:10.160
I wasn't hard on Kou Lianyi.

16:10.830 --> 16:12.770
I don't see the need for you to defend her.

16:14.070 --> 16:15.700
It has nothing to do with her

16:16.800 --> 16:18.526
but with something in the past.

16:18.550 --> 16:20.000
What's it?

16:20.190 --> 16:23.260
It's related to me

16:23.400 --> 16:25.080
and you.

16:25.330 --> 16:27.090
Around the 20th year of Tianqing,

16:27.880 --> 16:30.186
eight censors together with many other officials

16:30.210 --> 16:32.100
complained to His Majesty

16:32.230 --> 16:34.270
that your reform was too radical.

16:34.620 --> 16:36.630
His Majesty expelled you from the capital because of that.

16:37.110 --> 16:38.870
I guess since then,

16:39.420 --> 16:41.416
you've been biding your time

16:41.440 --> 16:43.130
for this big plan.

16:44.230 --> 16:45.686
Not long after you left,

16:45.710 --> 16:48.750
those eight censors and their families

16:48.900 --> 16:50.430
either died in accidents

16:51.280 --> 16:52.750
or got murdered.

16:56.040 --> 16:57.510
Really?

16:59.790 --> 17:01.226
If that were true,

17:01.250 --> 17:03.660
the imperial court would have brought me to book.

17:03.820 --> 17:05.926
I studied in the Yuntai Sect for 15 years.

17:05.950 --> 17:08.485
I know you have wisdom and a big heart,

17:08.509 --> 17:11.540
so I'm sure you didn't do that.

17:12.880 --> 17:15.040
Then who did it?

17:15.270 --> 17:16.955
And how did you know about it?

17:16.979 --> 17:18.996
Liu Gongquan always wants to use the Yuntai Sect

17:19.020 --> 17:21.046
to find evidence of your treason.

17:21.070 --> 17:22.606
I agreed to help him on the condition

17:22.630 --> 17:25.170
that he'd help me get to the bottom of this matter.

17:28.540 --> 17:31.220
So Liu Gongquan went to the east coast

17:31.310 --> 17:33.416
to investigate this case.

17:33.440 --> 17:34.890
Yes.

17:35.360 --> 17:36.526
Nangong Fang was the mastermind

17:36.550 --> 17:39.910
of the east-coast land purchase case in the 26th year of Tianqing.

17:40.160 --> 17:42.000
He took down Mr. Wen

17:42.100 --> 17:44.170
and submitted his pledge to the Lingyuan Sect.

17:45.970 --> 17:48.046
Then why did he kill the whole Luo family's village

17:48.070 --> 17:49.916
on the pretext of buying land?

17:49.940 --> 17:51.980
Because one of the eight censors

17:52.050 --> 17:54.140
was about to retire and return to his hometown.

17:54.590 --> 17:57.670
His hometown was the Luo family's village.

17:57.760 --> 17:58.866
Over the years,

17:58.890 --> 18:00.916
Nangong Fang never mentioned it.

18:00.940 --> 18:02.500
There's only one explanation.

18:03.870 --> 18:05.850
Once the time was right,

18:05.940 --> 18:08.796
he would blame that atrocity on you.

18:08.820 --> 18:12.070
You wouldn't be able to prove yourself innocent.

18:22.020 --> 18:23.470
You are

18:25.780 --> 18:27.360
from the Luo family's village?

18:29.350 --> 18:30.800
Yes.

18:31.870 --> 18:34.030
Now I know the whole story.

18:34.190 --> 18:35.646
It explains why you didn't listen to me

18:35.670 --> 18:37.176
after you left the mountain

18:37.200 --> 18:39.286
and caused quite a stir in Nandu.

18:39.310 --> 18:42.306
So it's all about a blood feud.

18:42.330 --> 18:43.126
Yes.

18:43.150 --> 18:44.190
Why didn't you tell me

18:44.190 --> 18:46.230
about Nangong Fang until today?

18:46.450 --> 18:49.256
I didn't want to put you in a dilemma.

18:49.280 --> 18:52.000
Aren't you afraid of him telling on you to me?

18:53.150 --> 18:54.600
No.

18:58.500 --> 19:01.420
You know that in my heart

19:01.650 --> 19:03.546
you're more important than him.

19:03.570 --> 19:05.020
I won't assume that.

19:07.070 --> 19:08.620
You're right.

19:08.870 --> 19:10.746
I need all hands on deck now.

19:10.770 --> 19:13.690
I wanted you to go to Yangzhou with me.

19:13.750 --> 19:15.910
But now it seems

19:16.150 --> 19:17.886
that you should go to Nandu

19:17.910 --> 19:19.750
and make arrangements in advance.

19:20.390 --> 19:23.150
I'll go where you want me to go.

19:25.110 --> 19:27.806
Take your Kou Lianyi with you.

19:27.830 --> 19:30.386
Get prepared after you arrive in Nandu.

19:30.410 --> 19:31.846
Yes.

19:31.870 --> 19:33.320
All right. Go.

19:41.420 --> 19:43.276
Do you really trust Yun Xiang

19:43.300 --> 19:44.830
and plan to put him in an important position?

19:47.070 --> 19:48.786
Take your best men

19:48.810 --> 19:50.796
and escort him to Nandu.

19:50.820 --> 19:53.390
You want me to protect him and watch over him?

20:43.640 --> 20:45.200
Don't hurt yourself.

20:55.150 --> 20:56.600
Yanan.

20:57.910 --> 20:59.360
You still have me.

21:14.270 --> 21:17.470
There are so many things I haven't done for her.

21:19.750 --> 21:22.230
I can't do them for her anymore.

21:31.560 --> 21:33.580
My father passed away when I was young.

21:35.600 --> 21:38.446
I always hoped that I could grow up sooner

21:38.470 --> 21:40.150
to share Mother's burden.

21:42.630 --> 21:44.860
Mother was a tough woman

21:45.110 --> 21:47.070
and a disciple of the Lingyuan Sect.

21:48.390 --> 21:51.660
I thought a lot about how she might die,

21:53.310 --> 21:56.760
but never in this way.

22:13.590 --> 22:16.140
How could someone's heart be so corrupt?

22:19.100 --> 22:20.550
That guy,

22:21.910 --> 22:23.630
how do you want him to pay?

22:37.170 --> 22:38.296
Prince Fu.

22:38.320 --> 22:39.636
Did you get the seal?

22:39.660 --> 22:41.006
All branches of the Lingyuan Sect

22:41.030 --> 22:42.990
can be deployed with this seal.

22:43.100 --> 22:44.746
Now that we have it,

22:44.770 --> 22:46.700
all branches are yours to command.

22:48.760 --> 22:53.340
Your sister has found out what you did to Madam Kou.

22:58.210 --> 23:02.110
There's no Madam Kou anymore.

23:06.670 --> 23:08.870
You're right.

23:09.890 --> 23:11.490
Master Kou,

23:11.640 --> 23:15.126
I'll depart to Yangzhou tomorrow to gather the troops.

23:15.150 --> 23:17.226
You'll wait at the Lingyuan branch.

23:17.250 --> 23:19.526
After I arrange everything,

23:19.550 --> 23:21.430
you'll rise up when I tell you to

23:21.950 --> 23:26.030
and catch the border barracks off guard.

23:27.220 --> 23:29.990
Why don't we rise up together?

23:32.020 --> 23:33.746
Winning the first battle at the border

23:33.770 --> 23:35.910
is a great honor.

23:36.110 --> 23:37.870
I never doubt

23:37.870 --> 23:39.790
that you're trustworthy.

23:40.060 --> 23:41.886
But there are people who object

23:41.910 --> 23:43.700
to my joining forces with you.

23:44.470 --> 23:47.310
You need a great deed to shut them up.

23:51.590 --> 23:52.606
Rest assured, Prince Fu.

23:52.630 --> 23:54.560
I won't fail you in this.

23:55.500 --> 23:57.010
Master Kou.

23:57.390 --> 23:58.840
You're very talented.

24:00.370 --> 24:02.406
You'll make great achievements in the future.

24:02.430 --> 24:04.070
After we succeed,

24:04.610 --> 24:06.890
how about you rule the north and I rule the south?

24:07.900 --> 24:09.296
We can discuss this

24:09.320 --> 24:11.080
after I break through the border defenses.

24:11.970 --> 24:13.420
Okay.

24:26.590 --> 24:28.040
Father.

24:28.440 --> 24:30.360
Did you stay up all night again?

24:46.170 --> 24:48.300
I told you

24:48.490 --> 24:51.300
that you don't have to worry about those things.

24:53.470 --> 24:54.846
I know.

24:54.870 --> 24:56.430
I'll go to Yangzhou.

24:56.500 --> 24:58.206
You stay here.

24:58.230 --> 24:59.526
I'll ask someone to keep you company.

24:59.550 --> 25:01.000
Father.

25:01.340 --> 25:03.196
I've packed my things.

25:03.220 --> 25:04.750
I'll go with you.

25:10.630 --> 25:12.080
Mingzhu.

25:13.100 --> 25:16.550
You know why I'm leaving for Yangzhou.

25:16.950 --> 25:18.206
War is coming.

25:18.230 --> 25:20.700
This is the safest place.

25:22.100 --> 25:24.140
If all my family is gone,

25:24.970 --> 25:26.760
what's the point of staying somewhere safe?

25:28.020 --> 25:29.086
Father.

25:29.110 --> 25:30.570
I've made up my mind.

25:30.700 --> 25:34.000
Do you remember me going to Nandu all alone?

25:34.790 --> 25:37.340
If you insist on leaving me behind,

25:37.440 --> 25:39.770
I’m afraid I'll go to Yangzhou alone to find you again.

25:40.760 --> 25:42.850
But if you go with me,

25:43.420 --> 25:44.130
I'm afraid...

25:44.150 --> 25:45.600
It doesn't matter.

25:50.270 --> 25:51.720
Fine.

26:03.060 --> 26:04.706
Let's do as we planned.

26:04.730 --> 26:06.250
You must be careful.

26:10.810 --> 26:13.490
Miss Kou, is Yun Xiang here?

26:14.190 --> 26:15.640
Yes.

26:22.430 --> 26:23.426
Your Highness.

26:23.450 --> 26:24.960
Let's talk somewhere else.

26:41.020 --> 26:42.940
Actually, I came to say goodbye.

26:43.500 --> 26:46.216
After we part ways today,

26:46.240 --> 26:48.450
I don't know what it'll be like when we meet again.

26:48.670 --> 26:50.870
I didn't expect you to go to Yangzhou too.

26:50.950 --> 26:52.326
I thought Prince Fu

26:52.350 --> 26:54.230
would let you stay here.

26:54.380 --> 26:56.200
I begged Father

26:56.330 --> 26:58.170
to take me with him.

26:58.590 --> 27:00.710
So many things happened recently.

27:01.750 --> 27:05.180
I find it hard to tell right from wrong.

27:05.610 --> 27:08.110
I'm just taking it one day at a time.

27:08.860 --> 27:10.570
At this point,

27:11.230 --> 27:12.886
I can only cherish what I have now.

27:12.910 --> 27:16.470
Yes. Take it one day at a time.

27:16.840 --> 27:18.290
That's good.

27:18.590 --> 27:20.040
Yun Xiang.

27:20.270 --> 27:22.230
I want to ask you one last time.

27:22.350 --> 27:25.766
Do you have any ways to stop my father

27:25.790 --> 27:27.680
and help him get out of this intact?

27:29.920 --> 27:32.500
Prince Fu's plans have always been foolproof.

27:32.630 --> 27:34.130
He'll be fine.

27:36.120 --> 27:37.570
Alright.

27:39.200 --> 27:41.286
Take care of yourself and Miss Kou.

27:41.310 --> 27:42.760
You too.

27:43.590 --> 27:45.500
Actually, I always have the feeling

27:46.330 --> 27:47.780
that you've already got a plan.

27:50.270 --> 27:51.990
But after all that's happened,

27:52.950 --> 27:54.896
I don't know what I can say

27:54.920 --> 27:56.370
or what I can do.

27:57.640 --> 28:00.600
I just hope you can

28:00.620 --> 28:02.486
look out for him

28:02.510 --> 28:05.580
for old times' sake.

28:23.210 --> 28:25.460
It'll be a long journey. Take care.

28:48.990 --> 28:51.756
You once said Yun Xiang is genius

28:51.780 --> 28:52.976
but too high-profile

28:53.000 --> 28:54.450
and sophisticated

28:54.530 --> 28:56.240
to be on a long leash.

28:56.550 --> 28:59.190
Why did you let him go so easily?

29:00.120 --> 29:01.800
Nangong Fang is dead.

29:02.090 --> 29:04.610
Nandu needs to be in the charge of someone capable.

29:05.940 --> 29:06.626
Besides,

29:06.650 --> 29:09.116
I had a talk with him last night.

29:09.140 --> 29:11.046
I finally knew

29:11.070 --> 29:14.750
why he was always so wayward.

29:16.070 --> 29:18.190
Compared to Nangong Fang,

29:18.650 --> 29:23.890
Yun Xiang understands better the core beliefs of the Yuntai Sect.

29:43.940 --> 29:45.550
Does he really trust you?

29:47.410 --> 29:49.450
I just wanted to leave here.

29:49.640 --> 29:51.090
I don't care whether he trusts me or not.

29:55.010 --> 29:56.930
Tell me how you want

29:57.310 --> 29:59.116
to hold your mother's funeral.

29:59.140 --> 30:00.590
I'll help you.

30:02.110 --> 30:03.620
She's gone now.

30:04.500 --> 30:06.620
I'll just give her one last ride.

30:19.110 --> 30:20.560
Mingyu.

30:21.530 --> 30:24.400
Although the Su family is not as prosperous as before,

30:24.860 --> 30:26.066
it still owns

30:26.090 --> 30:29.690
a sizable amount of properties in Nandu.

30:30.700 --> 30:33.526
How come you're reduced to selling all of them?

30:33.550 --> 30:35.886
What happened?

30:35.910 --> 30:37.256
Mr. Liu,

30:37.280 --> 30:38.906
I'd rather not say,

30:38.930 --> 30:41.850
but I do need money for something urgent.

30:42.470 --> 30:45.320
I'd be grateful if you could help me out.

30:48.730 --> 30:51.690
Every business of the Su family is making profits.

30:52.030 --> 30:54.516
I think you'll be able to make money

30:54.540 --> 30:56.036
the very day you take over them.

30:56.060 --> 30:57.650
There's nothing to lose.

30:58.950 --> 31:01.520
Mr. Su, you're so efficient.

31:01.620 --> 31:03.916
I heard that all the supplies we need

31:03.940 --> 31:05.286
have been purchased.

31:05.310 --> 31:06.806
You gave me an order.

31:06.830 --> 31:09.710
Of course I'd do my best to carry it out.

31:10.450 --> 31:13.046
But I heard

31:13.070 --> 31:15.690
that you're selling your family assets.

31:20.500 --> 31:22.240
Please have a look, Mr. Xu.

31:23.580 --> 31:25.916
You can see that the value of the military supplies I bought

31:25.940 --> 31:27.396
is way more than

31:27.420 --> 31:29.196
the 400,000 taels you approved.

31:29.220 --> 31:30.726
When it comes to wars,

31:30.750 --> 31:33.046
abundant supplies are the most important.

31:33.070 --> 31:34.536
I've made up my mind

31:34.560 --> 31:36.570
to take my chances.

31:36.800 --> 31:38.850
I don't care if I'll be broken.

31:39.020 --> 31:40.726
Even if I have to risk my life,

31:40.750 --> 31:42.446
I'll give Prince Fu my full support.

31:42.470 --> 31:46.166
I'm impressed by your insight and courage.

31:46.190 --> 31:48.090
You flatter me, Mr. Xu.

31:49.070 --> 31:52.636
I just hope you can put in a good word

31:52.660 --> 31:54.006
for me with Prince Fu.

31:54.030 --> 31:55.466
To be honest,

31:55.490 --> 31:57.606
I'm really not good at business.

31:57.630 --> 32:00.220
It'd be great

32:00.510 --> 32:02.280
if Prince Fu could give me an appointment.

32:02.310 --> 32:04.760
No problem.

32:07.580 --> 32:09.016
I'll see myself out.

32:09.040 --> 32:10.690
Take care, Mr. Xu.

32:16.590 --> 32:19.820
[Jishan Hall]

32:20.390 --> 32:24.030
These should be enough to fund the foundling home for a while.

32:29.070 --> 32:30.726
Not just for a while.

32:30.750 --> 32:33.486
They're enough to support the children for years.

32:33.510 --> 32:34.990
Miss Ke, what happened?

32:35.630 --> 32:39.250
Stay away from Liansheng House for a while.

32:39.310 --> 32:40.830
Did something happen?

32:41.490 --> 32:42.940
Nothing serious.

32:42.990 --> 32:44.510
We can handle it.

32:44.700 --> 32:46.940
Just take good care of the children.

32:49.960 --> 32:52.036
If riots break out,

32:52.060 --> 32:53.856
close the gate

32:53.880 --> 32:55.480
and wait for them to blow over.

32:55.870 --> 32:57.126
Also,

32:57.150 --> 32:58.830
no matter what happens in the future,

32:59.840 --> 33:02.120
make sure the foundling home stand.

33:05.110 --> 33:06.560
I will.

33:07.430 --> 33:09.070
I promised Jin to do that.

33:12.950 --> 33:14.820
Take me to see the children.

33:18.800 --> 33:21.370
Water and fire don't have lives.

33:21.720 --> 33:24.560
Water and fire don't have lives.

33:24.580 --> 33:26.846
Plants have lives but don't have emotions.

33:26.870 --> 33:30.176
Plants have lives but don't have emotions.

33:30.200 --> 33:32.806
Animals have emotions but don't have minds.

33:32.830 --> 33:35.406
Animals have emotions but don't have minds.

33:35.430 --> 33:38.486
Humans have lives, emotions,

33:38.510 --> 33:40.046
and minds.

33:40.070 --> 33:43.436
Humans have lives, emotions,

33:43.460 --> 33:44.780
and minds.

33:44.800 --> 33:46.880
After Jin died,

33:46.910 --> 33:49.830
they seem to have grown up overnight.

33:50.470 --> 33:51.950
They've all been very sweet.

33:55.310 --> 33:57.230
If Jin were still alive,

33:58.030 --> 33:59.710
he'd be so relieved

34:01.720 --> 34:03.490
to see this.

34:08.750 --> 34:10.200
Tianhu.

34:13.140 --> 34:14.620
Take care of yourself

34:15.100 --> 34:16.660
and take care of the kids.

34:17.279 --> 34:19.150
Remember what I said.

34:20.350 --> 34:21.045
I have to go.

34:21.069 --> 34:23.910
The jade in the mountain nourishes all the plants.

34:24.549 --> 34:27.470
The pearl in the river keeps the flowers on the band from withering.

34:28.350 --> 34:30.986
The jade in the mountain nourishes all the plants.

34:31.010 --> 34:33.806
The pearl in the river keeps the flowers on the band from withering.

34:33.830 --> 34:36.300
If one keeps doing good things.

34:36.879 --> 34:38.800
You wouldn't tell me what happened,

34:39.810 --> 34:41.610
so I won't pry into it.

34:42.790 --> 34:46.030
But no matter what, stay alive.

34:47.109 --> 34:48.910
I'll be waiting for you.

34:50.170 --> 34:51.620
Okay.

34:53.930 --> 34:56.315
The pearl in the river keeps the flowers on the band from withering.

34:56.339 --> 34:57.206
I'll go.

34:57.230 --> 35:00.046
The pearl in the river keeps the flowers on the band from withering.

35:00.070 --> 35:02.166
If one keeps doing good things.

35:02.190 --> 35:04.230
If one keeps doing good things.

35:04.230 --> 35:05.956
How's it possible that they'll stay obscure forever?

35:05.980 --> 35:08.940
How's it possible that they'll stay obscure forever?

35:12.190 --> 35:13.640
Master Kou.

35:16.510 --> 35:17.636
Master Kou.

35:17.660 --> 35:19.110
It's time to set off.

35:19.290 --> 35:20.740
Master Kou.

35:21.800 --> 35:23.250
It's time to set off.

35:25.160 --> 35:27.566
It's just visiting the Lingyuan branch.

35:27.590 --> 35:29.640
There's no need to rush.

35:32.150 --> 35:33.600
Master Kou.

35:33.890 --> 35:36.140
I found this when I cleaned Kou Lianyi's room.

35:36.230 --> 35:38.290
No one can tell what's in it.

35:45.230 --> 35:48.270
Of course you can't tell what it is.

35:48.520 --> 35:50.150
This is Hidden Cold Scale.

35:50.260 --> 35:52.206
After ingestion, the skin turns livid

35:52.230 --> 35:53.340
and breathing ceases.

35:53.360 --> 35:54.786
The victim becomes like a hibernating snake.

35:54.810 --> 35:57.210
They won't wake up until three days later.

36:01.220 --> 36:02.506
Come with me to the back mountain now.

36:02.530 --> 36:03.726
Bring some men with you.

36:03.750 --> 36:05.200
Yes.

36:10.760 --> 36:11.536
Careful.

36:11.560 --> 36:13.010
Careful.

36:15.510 --> 36:15.906
Okay.

36:15.930 --> 36:17.380
Put it down.

36:37.990 --> 36:39.476
Where is Mr. Nangong?

36:39.500 --> 36:41.076
They haven't gone far.

36:41.100 --> 36:42.550
Go after them!

36:58.670 --> 36:59.916
Mr. Yun.

36:59.940 --> 37:01.266
Why did we stop?

37:01.290 --> 37:03.520
His Highness ordered us to go to Nandu without delay.

38:10.110 --> 38:12.080
Report it to Prince Fu now!

38:26.510 --> 38:28.296
Are you sure you can handle him?

38:28.320 --> 38:29.786
He and his men will catch up soon.

38:29.810 --> 38:31.260
It's okay.

38:31.360 --> 38:33.330
I just hope he comes sooner.

38:55.520 --> 38:58.280
Master Kou, why are you here?

39:17.190 --> 39:19.310
I found this in your room.

39:19.390 --> 39:21.246
I dug Nangong Fang's grave.

39:21.270 --> 39:22.746
His coffin is empty.

39:22.770 --> 39:24.650
You're already the Sect Master.

39:24.940 --> 39:26.796
Why can't you leave her alone

39:26.820 --> 39:28.776
and spare her that false accusation?

39:28.800 --> 39:30.310
False accusation?

39:30.870 --> 39:33.776
We'll know if it's false after we open the coffin.

39:33.800 --> 39:35.250
Stop!

39:39.800 --> 39:41.250
Think twice.

39:41.850 --> 39:43.740
It's your mother who's lying inside.

39:45.920 --> 39:47.730
Don't be fooled by him.

39:47.930 --> 39:50.496
Nangong Fang knows lots of Prince Fu's plans.

39:50.520 --> 39:53.646
He needs to be either dead or with us.

39:53.670 --> 39:55.120
Go get her!

40:53.770 --> 40:55.220
Watch out!

41:05.050 --> 41:06.696
Go catch Yun Xiang!

41:06.720 --> 41:08.170
Yes.

41:17.930 --> 41:19.530
Leave it to me. You go first.

41:29.620 --> 41:32.416
I move fast and this dagger is poisoned.

41:32.440 --> 41:34.210
I may be able to kill some of them.

41:38.040 --> 41:39.456
If we have to die, we die together.

41:39.480 --> 41:40.566
Then I'll grant your wish.

41:40.590 --> 41:42.040
Kill!

43:13.700 --> 43:14.896
Bring it on.

43:14.920 --> 43:16.370
Bring it on!

43:19.950 --> 43:21.886
Don't you want to die together?

43:21.910 --> 43:23.346
I'll chop off his hands and feet first.

43:23.370 --> 43:26.410
He'll wish he were dead!

43:43.030 --> 43:45.060
Don't kill me, Lianyi.

43:45.100 --> 43:46.026
They gave me no choice.

43:46.050 --> 43:47.900
I was forced to do all this.

43:49.510 --> 43:50.906
The seal.

43:50.930 --> 43:51.936
The seal.

43:51.960 --> 43:52.986
Lianyi.

43:53.010 --> 43:54.426
Here is the Sect Master's seal.

43:54.450 --> 43:56.126
I'll give the position of the Sect Master to you.

43:56.150 --> 43:57.506
I'm selfish and greedy.

43:57.530 --> 43:58.980
I deserve to die.

43:59.330 --> 44:00.536
But Lianyi,

44:00.560 --> 44:02.360
I'm your brother.

44:03.700 --> 44:04.886
And Mother.

44:04.910 --> 44:05.790
If Mother were here…

44:05.810 --> 44:07.536
How dare you mention her?

44:07.560 --> 44:09.560
The thing I hate most

44:10.230 --> 44:12.210
about living in this world

44:12.310 --> 44:16.030
is having a despicable brother like you.

45:11.150 --> 45:13.630
Thank you for your help, Lord Liu.

45:14.280 --> 45:16.030
Any time.

46:19.600 --> 46:21.310
Have you seen Yun Xiang?

46:34.690 --> 46:36.410
The imperial edict has been drafted.

46:36.690 --> 46:38.676
As long as the Lingyuan Sect stays out of this,

46:38.700 --> 46:40.326
when the dust settles,

46:40.350 --> 46:41.996
the court will make things right

46:42.020 --> 46:43.890
and no longer treat its disciples as rebels.

46:48.490 --> 46:49.306
Thank you, Lord Liu.

46:49.330 --> 46:50.780
Save it.

46:50.810 --> 46:53.010
I just fulfilled my promise to you.

46:57.870 --> 46:59.526
Time is pressing.

46:59.550 --> 47:02.110
She has to go now to stop the Lingyuan Sect's branches from joining the uprising.

47:02.470 --> 47:03.976
So she can't go with us

47:04.000 --> 47:06.326
to meet Her Majesty.

47:06.350 --> 47:07.800
Okay.

47:07.830 --> 47:09.506
If you need assistance,

47:09.530 --> 47:10.980
I can provide you men.

47:11.870 --> 47:13.320
I can do it on my own.

47:13.770 --> 47:15.910
Then I'll leave it to you, Miss Kou.

47:16.020 --> 47:18.326
Please keep the Lingyuan Sect's branches in check.

47:18.350 --> 47:19.646
Otherwise, when the war begins,

47:19.670 --> 47:21.190
numerous people will die.

47:21.230 --> 47:23.820
Neither Yingyuan, Yuntai, nor the court

47:23.900 --> 47:26.060
can be the so-called winner.

47:55.440 --> 47:57.620
The fire in Yufeng Warehouse back then

47:58.130 --> 48:00.220
drew the Su family into perpetual conflict.

48:00.540 --> 48:04.540
Hope this fire can put an end to everything.

48:07.980 --> 48:09.430
Let's go.

48:18.640 --> 48:19.356
Mr. Xu.

48:19.380 --> 48:20.646
There's another fire in the city.

48:20.670 --> 48:21.486
Where?

48:21.510 --> 48:23.030
The Su family's warehouse.

48:57.860 --> 48:59.380
That's it?

49:00.290 --> 49:03.480
People in the Lingyuan Sect never take death too seriously.

49:04.060 --> 49:06.020
We don't believe in the afterlife either.

49:06.870 --> 49:11.056
Our secret soldiers are always ready to die.

49:11.080 --> 49:12.880
Mother was the same.

49:16.850 --> 49:19.686
This is a beautiful place.

49:19.710 --> 49:22.990
If her ghost were still around, she'd find peace of mind here.

49:24.660 --> 49:26.500
There's no coming back from the dead.

49:26.720 --> 49:29.030
She's part of the mountain now.

49:31.870 --> 49:33.990
Mother lived an eventful life,

49:34.610 --> 49:36.620
but she's six feet under now like we all will be.

49:45.950 --> 49:47.400
Yun Xiang.

49:48.870 --> 49:51.130
Do you know what it means

49:51.580 --> 49:53.030
to continue on this path?

49:55.620 --> 49:57.230
Of course.

49:59.540 --> 50:00.990
But I'm tired.

50:02.870 --> 50:04.860
When it dawns,

50:05.070 --> 50:05.750
I'll have to face

50:05.770 --> 50:08.810
unceasing tumult

50:09.790 --> 50:11.056
and conflict again.

50:11.080 --> 50:13.340
Plot against others and be plotted against.

50:15.260 --> 50:17.010
I'm so fed up with all that.

50:19.700 --> 50:22.860
I'll personally order all the branches to dismiss the secret soldiers,

50:25.760 --> 50:28.080
but this is the last time I help you.

50:33.430 --> 50:34.880
Are you leaving?

50:37.710 --> 50:39.860
You've allied with the court.

50:40.980 --> 50:44.770
After the rebellion is quelled, you'll surely be recruited by the court.

50:46.110 --> 50:47.940
You should avoid getting involved with us bandits.

50:50.120 --> 50:52.416
So I guess we have to say goodbye.

50:51.990 --> 50:55.890
♫ It's dark but friends are not back ♫

50:56.850 --> 51:01.060
♫ The night breeze can't understand sadness and heartache ♫

51:01.630 --> 51:05.380
♫ Rain falls all night long and I stay awake ♫

51:06.540 --> 51:10.860
♫ The night rain can't conceal the sorrow ♫

51:11.110 --> 51:15.360
♫ Memory is a book ♫

51:15.920 --> 51:20.340
♫ Who wrote all those stories ♫

51:19.310 --> 51:20.760
Take this.

51:20.890 --> 51:25.130
♫ Without realizing it ♫

51:25.510 --> 51:30.086
♫ So many years have passed ♫

51:28.250 --> 51:29.700
What's this?

51:30.110 --> 51:33.320
♫ Flowers fall into the garden ♫

51:32.630 --> 51:34.110
Just trust me.

51:33.870 --> 51:38.976
♫ Dear friends, why haven't we met earlier ♫

51:39.000 --> 51:47.680
♫ Destiny is so cruel ♫

51:48.640 --> 51:51.686
♫ The cloud disperses and mountains are seen ♫

51:51.710 --> 51:53.996
♫ How many old friends are gone ♫

51:54.020 --> 51:56.350
♫ I raise my cup to beckon the bright moon ♫

51:56.350 --> 51:58.876
♫ People I miss are thousands of miles away ♫

51:58.900 --> 52:03.636
♫ We let go of the past ♫

52:03.660 --> 52:07.926
♫ Stories take place thousands of miles away ♫

52:07.950 --> 52:10.856
♫ The cloud disperses and mountains are seen ♫

52:10.880 --> 52:13.216
♫ How many old friends are gone ♫

52:13.240 --> 52:15.600
♫ I raise my cup to beckon the bright moon ♫

52:15.600 --> 52:18.006
♫ People I miss are thousands of miles away ♫

52:18.030 --> 52:22.846
♫ We let go of the past ♫

52:22.870 --> 52:27.956
♫ Stories take place thousands of miles away ♫

